      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_YqlqKXvHYpzR8Zs8",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Imagine satisfying cravings without harmful habits. Lio® offers naturally infused air for guilt-free relief—no chemicals, smoke, vapour, or nicotine. With <strong>100% natural ingredients</strong>, a <strong>portable design</strong>, and over <strong>50,000 happy customers</strong>, Lio is your natural path to quitting.</p>"
