        "text_ZdxZhjp7kcTR6ehU": "<h3>PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h3>",
        "text_XuzYOLqduSjDDB27": "<h3>Lio is the flavored air diffuser that makes quitting <strong>simple and enjoyable</strong>. Relief cravings and keep your hand-to-mouth habit—<strong>anytime, anywhere—without nicotine, vapor, or smoke.</strong></h3>",
        "text_c6fZg3mjniBqbTBt": "<h3>SHIPPING &amp; DELIVERY</h3>",
        "text_FvOENvdiexYaY4hT": "<h3></h3><ul><li><h3><strong>Benelux:</strong> 1-2 business days</h3></li><li><h3><strong>Europe (outside Benelux):</strong> 2-4 business days</h3></li><li><h3><strong>Outside Europe:</strong> 5-7 business days</h3></li><li><h3><strong>Middle East (outside UAE):</strong> 2-3 business days</h3></li></ul><h3></h3><h3><strong>Free shipping</strong> on orders over €39.</h3><h3></h3><h3>Your order will be processed within 5 hours and shipped from our fulfilment center.</h3>",
        "text_KuCkzdrZZKHGqfDz": "<h3>After two years of hard work, countless improvements, and valuable user feedback, we’re proud to introduce the Lio® Gen 2—a more practical and enjoyable solution.</h3><h3>Unlike the Lio Classic, the Lio® Gen 2 is easier to clean, allowing you to fully savor the flavors.</h3><h3>It also features an adjustable airflow, so you can customize the draw resistance to your liking. You can even close it completely, making your Cores last longer!</h3><h3>And no more fraying the Cores! The Lio® Gen 2 Cores are hollow, meaning no more messy fingers!</h3>",
        "text_EA9PAqtZqyTO5S5M": "<h3>IS LIO® SAFE?</h3>",
        "text_haNKjDoBaqRyRgoP": "<h3><strong>Safety first, always</strong>! Every natural plant compound in our products goes through serious third-party testing. These tests (plus a bunch of studies) prove that what you&apos;re inhaling is <strong>safe and effective</strong>. We&apos;re all about research to make sure you get a reliable, natural, non-electric option that keeps you healthy without skimping on safety or results.</h3>",
        "text_HomAftWy44aJ715p": "<h3>WHAT&apos;S IN A STARTERPACK?</h3>",
        "text_yRHNy8EIyDU82M46": "<h3><strong>LIO® GEN 2 STARTER PACK</strong></h3><h3>1x Lio® Gen 2 – made from stainless steel 1x Lio® Cleaning Kit – to keep your Lio® Gen 2 spotless 1x Lio® Leather Carry Case – for on-the-go convenience 1x Lio® Habit Tracker – to monitor your progress</h3><h3></h3><h3><strong>LIO® CLASSIC STARTER PACK</strong></h3><h3>1x Lio® Classic – crafted from olive or walnut wood 1x Lio® Carry Case – for on-the-go convenience 1x Lio® Habit Tracker – to track your progress</h3><h3></h3><h3>Finally, choose 3, 6, or 9 bags of your favorite flavor Cores. Each bag contains 3 Cores, with each Core lasting 10 days. Three bags give you a full month of refreshing air!</h3>",
        "text_1IXxATUlLoCn35Nu": "<h3>DIFFERENCE CLASSIC &amp; GEN 2 </h3>",
        "text_iHupk6O7kEIEkqVA": "<h3>After two years of hard work, countless improvements, and valuable user feedback, we’re proud to introduce the Lio® Gen 2—a more practical and enjoyable solution.</h3><h3>Unlike the Lio Classic, the Lio® Gen 2 is easier to clean, allowing you to fully savor the flavors.</h3><h3>It also features an adjustable airflow, so you can customize the draw resistance to your liking. You can even close it completely, making your Cores last longer!</h3><h3>And no more fraying the Cores! The Lio® Gen 2 Cores are hollow, meaning no more messy fingers!</h3>",
