        "text_SLNBNG7OTgES62Au": "<h3>You bet! Lio is powered by nature—<strong>no nicotine, smoke, vapor, or harmful chemicals</strong>, just pure goodness. Each Core is medical-grade &amp; soaked in a special blend of pure <strong>essential oils</strong>, sourced from farms across the globe. Think of it as a breath of fresh air, straight from nature’s finest!</h3>",
        "text_IW4uwGhpQ2kUgd6f": "<h3>WHAT&apos;S IN A STARTERPACK?</h3>",
        "text_3nk1ZQU8IJ1u39wI": "<h3><strong>LIO® GEN 2 STARTER PACK</strong></h3><h3>1x Lio® Gen 2 – made from stainless steel 1x Lio® Cleaning Kit – to keep your Lio® Gen 2 spotless 1x Lio® Leather Carry Case – for on-the-go convenience 1x Lio® Habit Tracker – to monitor your progress</h3><h3></h3><h3><strong>LIO® CLASSIC STARTER PACK</strong></h3><h3>1x Lio® Classic – crafted from olive or walnut wood 1x Lio® Carry Case – for on-the-go convenience 1x Lio® Habit Tracker – to track your progress</h3><h3></h3><h3>Finally, choose 3, 6, or 9 bags of your favorite flavor Cores. Each bag contains 3 Cores, with each Core lasting 10 days. Three bags give you a full month of refreshing air!</h3>",
        "text_6wbOEeJjsIOtwuIY": "<p>NO NICOTINE, NO VAPOUR, NO SMOKE</p>",
        "text_J5VYnVOhTBJ2kECV": "<h3>WHAT IS LIO®?</h3>",
        "text_YqlqKXvHYpzR8Zs8": "<p>Imagine satisfying cravings without harmful habits. Lio® offers naturally infused air for guilt-free relief—no chemicals, smoke, vapour, or nicotine. With <strong>100% natural ingredients</strong>, a <strong>portable design</strong>, and over <strong>50,000 happy customers</strong>, Lio is your natural path to quitting.</p>",
        "text_2e4bBfho6QKsbj9S": "<p>WHAT OUR CUSTOMERS SAY</p>",
        "text_KEoFzLga1mq81Usr": "<h3>Watch THE LIO® experiences.</h3>",
        "text_wwI7DTCb8YAre1Ex": "<p>See what our customers have to say! Watch their real experiences and hear honest feedback in their own words.</p>",
        "text_mnFbR8I8ZIZDpODY": "<p>TRUELY BREAK FREE</p>",
        "text_QX6bDhgezs96EW0T": "<h3>WHY LIO®?</h3>",
        "text_7qhRT183z17NTVSK": "<p>Notice how all replacement therapies, like patches or gum, still contain nicotine? That means you’re just keeping the problem alive, never truly breaking free. <strong>With Lio, you don&apos;t just replace the habit—you overcome it</strong>, without relying on nicotine, vapor, or smoke.</p>",
        "text_uzyxM6pTqxpHCFtZ": "<p>Over 50.000 customers successfully quit</p>",
        "text_Ici5PD38FTLq4Mrq": "<p>100% nicotine-free, fully break free.</p>",
        "text_0P42GQip5Yoms7sk": "<p>Enjoy delicious air while relieving cravings</p>",
        "text_eT0mjzc8pmxZzx3M": "<p>Portable design. Use it anytime, anywhere.</p>",
        "text_BpAPKuyLgqXgyrnP": "<p>NO NICOTINE, NO VAPOUR, NO SMOKE</p>",
        "text_KihKizwRLoD9q3bh": "<h3>No nicotine, no vapor, just natural relief.</h3>",
        "text_0JettdIlIdfxrzdu": "<p>Imagine a world where you can satisfy cravings without the usual harmful habits. Lio® is more than just flavored air—it’s about reimagining how you handle those urges. With naturally infused air, your cravings become a calming, flavorful moment. No chemicals, no guilt—just pure relief, literally, from thin air—all thanks to Lio®.</p>",
        "text_pqHyslJOrRofQFJw": "<p>how Lio® changes lives </p>",
        "text_RqoC04kqJP9kwYDC": "<h3><strong>Loved by over 50,000 happy customers.</strong></h3>",
        "text_0gXYzXjJRjV8ayQu": "<p>Join over 50,000 people worldwide who’ve kicked bad habits naturally with Lio®&apos;s non-electric, nicotine-free technology. Just breathe in flavoured air, infused with natural ingredients, and turn cravings into refreshing moments of relief. Healthy, simple, and always ready.</p>",
